        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Ambiguity about product scope: universal remote vs TV remote."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004b#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Feasibility: the proposed price around 25 EUR may be too high given production cost of 12.5 EUR."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004b#3",
        "type": "decisions",
